# =====================================================================
# PROVING GROUNDS OF THE MAD OVERLORD
# An adventure module for TUNNELS OF DOOM (PicoMite / PicoCalc),
# freely inspired by Sir-Tech's 1981 dungeon crawl "Wizardry".
# Ten maze levels, four things to find, and Werdna waiting at the end.
# All text here is original. See README.md for the file format.
# =====================================================================

TITLE,Wizardry

INTRO,Proving Grounds of the Mad Overlord.
INTRO,The overlord Trebor is a proud man and a foolish one. A wizard
INTRO,named Werdna has stolen the amulet that guards the realm and has
INTRO,carried it ten levels down beneath the castle. Find the three
INTRO,keys that open his sanctum, take back the amulet, and climb out.

WIN,You climb into the courtyard with the amulet burning cold in your hands. Trebor has his treasure back, and your names are cut into the castle wall.
FAIL,The maze keeps what it takes. Somewhere below, Werdna laughs and returns to his work.

